{"seq":2,"slug":"secure-multiparty-computation","title":"安全多方计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/secure-multiparty-computation","wordCount":2077,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全多方计算\">安全多方计算</h1><p>两家医院想知道某种罕见病在两院合并人群中的真实发病率，但任何一方都不愿把病人名单交给对方，监管也禁止这种原始数据外流。安全多方计算（Secure Multiparty Computation，MPC）正是为这类「想共享计算结果、却谁都不肯共享原始输入」的死结而生：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个互不信任的参与方各持私有输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，共同算出函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x_1, \\dots, x_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，过程中除了输出本身（及输出能反推的信息），任何一方都学不到他方输入的任何额外比特。它把「可信第三方」这个现实中往往并不存在的角色，用密码学协议替换掉了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MPC 的安全目标可以用一个理想世界来定义：假想有一个绝对可信的预言机，各方把输入私下交给它，它算完只回吐结果。一个 MPC 协议「安全」，当且仅当现实世界里攻击者能做的坏事，在那个理想世界里也照样能做——这就是模拟器（simulator）证明范式。攻击者模型分两档：半诚实（honest-but-curious，老实执行协议但偷看中间消息）和恶意（malicious，可任意篡改消息）。能扛住后者的协议代价高得多，因为要额外附带正确性的密码学校验。</p>\n<p>下图勾勒三大技术支柱如何在一次计算里协作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[私有输入 x1..xn] --&gt; B[秘密分享&lt;br/&gt;把每个值拆成随机份额]&#10;  A --&gt; C[混淆电路&lt;br/&gt;把布尔逻辑加密成真值表]&#10;  B --&gt; D[算术电路求值&lt;br/&gt;加法本地做 乘法需通信]&#10;  C --&gt; E[不经意传输&lt;br/&gt;取出正确密钥不暴露选择]&#10;  D --&gt; F[重构输出 f]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[仅输出可见 输入零泄露]\">flowchart TD\n  A[私有输入 x1..xn] --&gt; B[秘密分享&lt;br/&gt;把每个值拆成随机份额]\n  A --&gt; C[混淆电路&lt;br/&gt;把布尔逻辑加密成真值表]\n  B --&gt; D[算术电路求值&lt;br/&gt;加法本地做 乘法需通信]\n  C --&gt; E[不经意传输&lt;br/&gt;取出正确密钥不暴露选择]\n  D --&gt; F[重构输出 f]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[仅输出可见 输入零泄露]</pre><p>三种范式各有适用面，下表对照其核心权衡。这也是工程选型时第一道分水岭。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术范式</th>\n<th>代表协议</th>\n<th>擅长的计算</th>\n<th>通信瓶颈</th>\n<th>典型轮数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算术秘密分享</td>\n<td>SPDZ、Shamir</td>\n<td>大量加法/乘法（如线性代数）</td>\n<td>每次乘法一轮交互</td>\n<td>与电路深度成正比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔混淆电路</td>\n<td>Yao、BMR</td>\n<td>比较、位运算、非线性函数</td>\n<td>电路体积大、带宽吃紧</td>\n<td>常数轮（Yao 两方为常数轮）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不经意传输</td>\n<td>OT 扩展</td>\n<td>作为前两者的底层原语</td>\n<td>预处理阶段可批量摊销</td>\n<td>取决于上层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"秘密分享与算术电路\">秘密分享与算术电路</h2><p>把一个秘密值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个份额，使得任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个份额拼不出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、却有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个就能唯一恢复——这是 Shamir 门限秘密分享的核心，靠的是一条经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0, s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的随机多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x) = s + a_1 x + \\dots + a_t x^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9436em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 方拿到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。加法在份额上是「免费」的：各方把自己的份额相加，结果就是和的份额，无需通信。乘法才是真正的成本中心——两个秘密相乘会让多项式次数翻倍，必须靠一轮交互（经典手段是 Beaver 三元组）把次数降回来。</p>\n<p>正因如此，MPC 协议普遍采用预处理模型（preprocessing / offline-online）：把与具体输入无关的随机三元组在「离线阶段」批量生成好，等真实数据到位的「在线阶段」只做轻量的份额揭示，从而把延迟敏感的计算压到最短。SPDZ 系列（及其工程实现 MP-SPDZ）正是这条路线的主力。MP-SPDZ 把高层 Python 程序编译成字节码，由 C++ 写的虚拟机解释执行，并能在算术表示与二进制表示之间按收益自动切换；它支持基于秘密分享的多种协议，历史基准给出约 280 万到 970 万门/秒的吞吐（<a href=\"https://github.com/data61/MP-SPDZ\">GitHub data61/MP-SPDZ</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[秘密 s] --&gt; P[构造随机多项式&lt;br/&gt;p x = s + a1 x + ...]&#10;  P --&gt; H1[份额 p 1 给方1]&#10;  P --&gt; H2[份额 p 2 给方2]&#10;  P --&gt; H3[份额 p 3 给方3]&#10;  H1 --&gt; R[任意 t+1 份额]&#10;  H2 --&gt; R&#10;  H3 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; O[拉格朗日插值恢复 s]\">graph TD\n  S[秘密 s] --&gt; P[构造随机多项式&lt;br/&gt;p x = s + a1 x + ...]\n  P --&gt; H1[份额 p 1 给方1]\n  P --&gt; H2[份额 p 2 给方2]\n  P --&gt; H3[份额 p 3 给方3]\n  H1 --&gt; R[任意 t+1 份额]\n  H2 --&gt; R\n  H3 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; O[拉格朗日插值恢复 s]</pre><h2 id=\"混淆电路与不经意传输\">混淆电路与不经意传输</h2><p>当计算里出现大量比较、最大值、激活函数这类非线性逻辑时，算术电路会变得笨重，布尔混淆电路（Garbled Circuit）更合适。Yao 的原始构造面向两方：一方（garbler）把布尔电路的每个逻辑门做成「加密真值表」——给每根线的 0/1 各配一个随机密钥（wire label），用输入线密钥加密输出线密钥；另一方（evaluator）只持有与自己输入对应的那些密钥，逐门解密，最终只能算出输出，看不到中间任何明文比特（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_multi-party_computation\">Wikipedia: Secure multi-party computation</a>）。</p>\n<p>难点在于 evaluator 如何拿到「与自己输入对应」的那批密钥，又不让 garbler 知道它的输入是 0 还是 1。这正是不经意传输（Oblivious Transfer，OT）解决的：发送方持有两条消息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_0, m_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，接收方选一个比特 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 取走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，结果是接收方拿不到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{1-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、发送方也不知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。OT 是 MPC 的基石原语，无论混淆电路还是秘密分享路线都离不开它；实践中靠「OT 扩展」用少量公钥 OT 引导出海量对称密钥级 OT，把成本摊到可接受。</p>\n<p>混淆电路的代价是带宽：电路越大、密文越多。2026 年一项跨框架基准（评测 HPMPC、MPyC、MP-SPDZ、MOTION）专门在带宽受限、高延迟、丢包等多样网络条件下衡量真实负载，发现 MP-SPDZ 在多数用例与设置下优于 MOTION，而 MOTION 缺乏定点数计算、内存占用高、文档不足，工程落地更难（<a href=\"https://eprint.iacr.org/2026/183\">eprint 2026/183</a>）。这提醒工程师：MPC 的真实瓶颈常不在 CPU，而在参与方之间那条网络链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私集合求交与产业落地\">隐私集合求交与产业落地</h2><p>最常被部署到生产的 MPC 特例是隐私集合求交（Private Set Intersection，PSI）：两方各持一个私有集合，协议只揭示交集元素，对非交集元素零泄露（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/Projects/pec/psi\">NIST PEC: PSI</a>）。它的杀手级场景是「我想知道我们有没有共同项，但不想暴露我有哪些项」。苹果在「密码监控」（Password Monitoring）与儿童保护功能中用了这类技术，让用户本地比对自己的凭据是否出现在泄露库里，而服务端学不到用户的具体凭据；Google、Facebook 也用 PSI 做共享信息的挖掘与广告转化归因（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Private_set_intersection\">Wikipedia: Private set intersection</a>）。</p>\n<p>在合规语境里，MPC 的价值不只是技术炫技。从 GDPR 视角，MPC 可被视为一种技术保障措施与假名化（pseudonymization）手段：数据始终留在原始位置、不发生未授权传输，因而有助于满足 GDPR、HIPAA、CCPA 等的数据保护要求（<a href=\"https://iapp.org/news/a/multiparty-computation-as-supplementary-measure-and-potential-data-anonymization-tool\">IAPP: Multiparty computation as supplementary measure</a>）。这也契合上一节「数据最小化」与「目的限制」原则——参与方拿到的不再是原始数据，而是经协议过滤后的最小必要结果。MPC 也常与联邦学习、同态加密、差分隐私组合，以覆盖更多用例并堆叠多层隐私保障。</p>\n<p>下面用一个简化的两方 PSI 求交思路说明协议如何「只露交集」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 简化示意：基于不经意伪随机函数 (OPRF) 的两方 PSI&#10;# 实际生产协议需防恶意方、做哈希分桶与批处理&#10;def psi_party_a(set_a, oprf_key_holder_b):&#10;    # A 把每个元素经由 B 的 OPRF 盲化求值，B 学不到明文元素&#10;    tagged_a = {oprf_key_holder_b.blind_eval(x) for x in set_a}&#10;    return tagged_a&#10;&#10;def psi_intersect(tagged_a, tagged_b):&#10;    # 双方只比对 OPRF 标签，交集标签可还原为明文，非交集元素不可逆&#10;    return tagged_a &amp; tagged_b\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 简化示意：基于不经意伪随机函数 (OPRF) 的两方 PSI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实际生产协议需防恶意方、做哈希分桶与批处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> psi_party_a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(set_a, oprf_key_holder_b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # A 把每个元素经由 B 的 OPRF 盲化求值，B 学不到明文元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tagged_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {oprf_key_holder_b.blind_eval(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> set_a}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tagged_a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> psi_intersect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tagged_a, tagged_b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 双方只比对 OPRF 标签，交集标签可还原为明文，非交集元素不可逆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tagged_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tagged_b</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从研究走向部署是 2026 年的明确趋势：随着性能提升与新部署模型降低门槛，跨机构在敏感数据上协作而不牺牲机密性的机会前所未有（<a href=\"https://www.360iresearch.com/library/intelligence/secure-multiparty-computation\">360iResearch: SMPC 市场 2026-2032</a>）。生产化的另一支撑是机密计算硬件——用可信执行环境把计算与宿主 OS/虚拟机监控器隔离，提供数据机密性的硬件保证并兼顾可审计与合规（<a href=\"https://openmetal.io/resources/blog/confidential-computing-for-multi-party-computation-how-bare-metal-infrastructure-enables-secure-collaboration/\">OpenMetal: Confidential Computing for MPC</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MPC 让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个互不信任方共同计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x_1, \\dots, x_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，除输出外不泄露任何输入信息；安全性由「现实世界不强于理想世界」的模拟器范式定义，攻击者分半诚实与恶意两档。</li>\n<li>三大支柱各司其职：算术秘密分享擅长大量加乘（加法免费、乘法需一轮通信），布尔混淆电路擅长非线性逻辑（常数轮但吃带宽），不经意传输是两者共用的底层原语。</li>\n<li>预处理模型把与输入无关的随机量放到离线阶段批量生成，是 SPDZ/MP-SPDZ 等高性能框架的关键工程手法；MP-SPDZ 在 2026 跨框架基准中表现稳健。</li>\n<li>真实瓶颈常在网络而非算力——带宽、延迟、丢包决定 MPC 的实际可用性，选型须按计算形态与网络条件匹配协议范式。</li>\n<li>PSI 是落地最广的 MPC 特例（苹果密码监控、广告归因），MPC 在 GDPR/HIPAA/CCPA 下可作为假名化与技术保障措施，并常与联邦学习、同态加密、差分隐私组合使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全多方计算","id":"安全多方计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"秘密分享与算术电路","id":"秘密分享与算术电路"},{"level":2,"text":"混淆电路与不经意传输","id":"混淆电路与不经意传输"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私集合求交与产业落地","id":"隐私集合求交与产业落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同态加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/homomorphic-encryption"},"next":{"title":"可信执行环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/trusted-execution-environments"}}